# Doomsday Excruciator ({B}x6) is cast on turn 1 (Mox Jet's {B}, Dark Ritual turning it into {B}{B}{B}, Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B}).
# "When this creature enters, if it was cast, each player exiles all but the bottom six cards of their library face down":
# Bot1's library of ten loses four, Bot2's of nine loses three; both are left with exactly six, and seven cards sit in exile
# face down. At Bot1's next upkeep it draws a card ("At the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card"), besides its draw step:
# six cards left become four by main phase one of turn 3; Bot2 drew for turn 2, so its six became five.

